\f0\b Position Sizing (Subsystem X position sizing)
\f1\b0 \
Annual Cash Volatility Target [$] / 16 -> Daily Cash volatility target\
Annual Instrument Voalatility [$] / 16 -> Daily instrument value volatility (block size, currency factored in here)\
Volatility_scalar = Daily Cash volatility target/daily instrument value volatility (exp. weighted, 35d lookback)\
Subsystem position = final combined forecast * volatility_scalar\
